WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:03.465
 Nothing replaces
a human connection.

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:07.400
 And nothing is
going to get you

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:13.440
farther along than to be
able to connect with people.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.850
This class is not only going to
be about being a TV journalist,

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.350
though we're going
to get into that.

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.600
That's not what this is about.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:23.210
It's about negotiating, public
speaking, body language.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:27.430
Shoulders back, head
up, eye contact.

00:00:27.430 --> 00:00:30.640
I cannot think of any line of
work that you are not going

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.800
to benefit by communicating
effectively and authentically.

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:36.550
You can't fake it.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.050
You can't fake the funk, baby.

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:39.910
It's about sharing
with people how they

00:00:39.910 --> 00:00:42.250
can be a better communicator.

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.925
Tell you a secret.

00:00:44.925 --> 00:00:45.425
Listen.

00:00:49.050 --> 00:00:51.840
Genuinely take
interest in somebody.

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.400
Look somebody in the eye.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.097
When's the last time that
someone has done that?

00:00:57.097 --> 00:00:58.680
This is something
my mama used to say.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.230
"Make your mess your message."

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:05.129
Everybody's got something--
cancer, divorce, unemployment,

00:01:05.129 --> 00:01:06.310
fill in the blank.

00:01:06.310 --> 00:01:07.470
That's not the tragedy.

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.900
It's if you don't take
the time to understand,

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.700
why was that placed in my path,
what am I supposed to learn?

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:17.970
I remember when I went on
national TV with Diane Sawyer

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:19.320
by my side.

00:01:19.320 --> 00:01:21.480
She's holding my
hand and I announce

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:22.950
that I have breast cancer.

00:01:22.950 --> 00:01:25.080
When you allow yourself
to be vulnerable,

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:28.530
you're showing a
strength, not a weakness.

00:01:28.530 --> 00:01:29.610
And people see that.

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.920
And people will
thank you for that.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:34.920
Yeah, there are times
when I'm still frightened.

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:38.910
But why would you let fear
keep you from your destiny?

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.160
You're looking at
that next lofty goal,

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:43.260
and you're like, oh, how
am I going get there?

00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:48.050
The secret to getting
ahead is getting started.

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.170
So let's get started.

00:01:50.170 --> 00:01:52.840
I'm Robin Roberts, and
this is my MasterClass.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.290
[MUSIC PLAYING]

